"%(time)s: it can be paid until then."
msgstr ""

#: pretix_sattleme/templates/pretix_sattleme/pending.html
#, python-format
msgid ""
"We received %(received)s sats, less than the amount of your order: please "
"pay the rest."
msgstr ""

#: pretix_sattleme/templates/pretix_sattleme/pending.html
msgid "Pay the rest with Bitcoin"
msgstr ""

#: pretix_sattleme/templates/pretix_sattleme/pending.html
msgid ""
"Your Bitcoin payment has arrived. It is being confirmed by the Bitcoin "
"network, which usually takes about 30 minutes: your order is then marked as "
"paid."
msgstr ""

